===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Honedge|98}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*'''Cut Up''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Pawniard|133}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
